 "text": "Hey, good to have you here. How are you? There are a few key things. A solid title and description that stands out. Having the podcast available on multiple platforms. And marketing it. Social media, tweets and posts that link to the episode. Offering it on blog you write for someone else. Even just telling people about it. Sure, you're welcome. Then an email newsletter each time it drops. Or live streaming it on Facebook. Yes, even just two or three episodes at first. People like to start from the beginning too. Then think about whether you want it to sound conversational with you and a friend or smooth and polished with music and bumpers. That decision dictates the software you use or need to buy hardware.",
